<title>MEXICO: New Telmex commercial paper issue rated.</title>
<headline>New Telmex commercial paper issue rated.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's has assigned a rating of mA-1+ to the new $3.0 billion pesos commercial paper program from Telefonos de Mexico, S.A. (Telmex), Standard &amp; Poor's said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>It said the rating was the highest for short-term paper on the CaVal scale, &quot;and indicated an extraordinary grade of security respect to the opportunity for payment of interest and principle.&quot;</p>
<p>It also confirmed earlier ratings for Telmex paper, it said.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728 9559))</p>
